                <note rend="inline" type="source">701.9111/493: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Iran</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Hornibrook</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Teheran</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1936-02-01T11:00:00+03:25">February 1, 1936—11
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received February 1—9:15 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>13. Your telegram No. 6, January 29th.<anchor n="7" xml:id="d434-f1"/>
                    Depositions transmitted to the Foreign Office today.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hornibrook</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
